Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 13:54:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 09/17] Deterministic ids for tokens, activated/triggered
 abilities and random modes (MageZero)

A game copy now continues the same id stream as the real game, so an action
the MCTS search picks in a copy names the same objects in the real game (a
Jace token's loyalty ability failed to activate without this). Ids are labels
only; library shuffles keep upstream's randomness so the search can't see the
deck order.
